# Third-party reference mods (downloaded, not ours to redistribute).
#
# Cleaned up 2026-09-06: the reference mods whose lessons were already
# extracted into this project's own code were deleted from disk, so their
# entries are gone from this list too. What remains below is the three that
# still bear on a genuinely OPEN question:
#   - Passive Pals / PassiveWildPals — two different routes to making wild
#     Pals non-hostile, directly relevant to the unsolved "a Pal keeps
#     fleeing/attacking even after its preset is swapped to friendly" bug.
#   - PalFollowerTweaks — the PalFunnelCharacter/BP_AIAction_FunnelFollow_C
#     secondary-follower system, the reference for the pre-capture wild
#     following question, which is the project's #1 open item.
#
# Deleted (do not re-add unless a new question needs them): Pal Analyzer,
# RemoteAccessEverything and VisiblePalCaptureCounter (all three were, in
# Dragón's own words, provided only to learn HOW widgets are manipulated in
# this game — that lesson now lives in Indicator.lua), QuickConsumableSlots
# (its one lesson, how to print on-screen info text, is implemented in
# Capture.NotifyJoined), MultiPals (its AddOtomoHandleToFreeSlot finding is
# extracted and capture works), Food Expansion and Schema Studio (never
# referenced by this project at all).
